  "visualBrief": "Curved concrete arch, both solid gravity wings, fifteen visually interpreted spillway openings, continuous mapped crest deck, stepped side outlet, paired low round outlets, and the separate hydroelectric bank with two covered runs, raised powerhouse, and lower outlet portals.",
  "heightPolicy": "The exact-Q dam outline and current crest bridge establish horizontal shape and facing. The named powerhouse location and two ordinary photographs control the approximate extent and features of the industrial bank. The retained 88 m height and 914 m length are distinct from the visible arch profile and sampled crest trace. One standard reservoir reference supplies the datum. Crest, sill, foundation, floor and tailwater levels are approximate.",
